# 8. OCR — CAPTURE TEXT

Implement real optical character recognition.

Requirements:

- Select an area or image.
- Extract readable text.
- Display the result in an editable text panel.
- Copy text to clipboard.
- Save extracted text to a file.
- Preserve line breaks where practical.
- Handle Unicode and Bangla text where the chosen OCR engine supports it.
- Support English and additional languages through optional language packs where practical.
- Display a useful error when a language model is missing.
- Allow users to choose between offline and online processing if both are implemented.

Prefer offline processing when practical for privacy.

Never upload screenshots to an external OCR service without clear disclosure and user consent.

Do not advertise Bangla OCR as supported until it has been tested with real Bangla samples.

