# 9. IMAGE AND FILE UTILITIES

Implement useful utilities without unnecessarily enlarging the application.

Possible features:

- Image conversion
- Image resizing
- Image compression
- Image dimensions and file information
- File renaming
- Clipboard image saving
- Batch conversion
- PDF export
- PDF creation from supported images
- Capture history
- Recent files

Use lazy loading for advanced tools.

Do not load every processing library when the application starts.

## PDF Export

- Export captured images to PDF.
- Support suitable page sizes and orientation.
- Preserve image quality according to export settings.
- Handle large images safely.
- Provide a meaningful error if export fails.

## Batch Operations

- Allow multiple files to be selected.
- Show the output directory.
- Prevent accidental overwriting.
- Report failures per file.
- Allow cancellation where practical.

