# 11. HOTKEYS AND QUICK ACCESS

Implement configurable global keyboard shortcuts using the native desktop integration.

Suggested defaults, subject to conflict checks:

- Full Screen Capture
- Region Capture
- Active Window Capture
- Open PixelGrip
- Start/Stop Recording
- Cancel Current Operation

Requirements:

- Register shortcuts through the desktop framework.
- Detect registration conflicts.
- Allow users to change shortcuts.
- Provide an option to disable individual shortcuts.
- Avoid hijacking common Windows shortcuts.
- Release shortcuts correctly on exit.
- Display an understandable error when a shortcut cannot be registered.

A keyboard listener inside a webpage is not a substitute for a global shortcut.

