- Keyboard navigation
- Visible focus indicators
- Screen-reader labels where practical
- Tooltips for icon-only controls
- Readable text and contrast
- Escape to cancel active selection where appropriate
- Confirmation for destructive actions
- Clear keyboard shortcuts
- Predictable window focus
- Consistent Undo and Redo behaviour

Ensure the application remains usable at different Windows scaling levels.

