20. Test clean application exit.

## Performance Tests

- Repeated screenshot capture
- Large images
- Long recording sessions
- Repeated opening and closing of the editor
- Multiple pinned images
- Idle operation for an extended period
- Startup with Windows, when enabled
- Memory and CPU monitoring

## Compatibility Tests

Test supported Windows versions and:

- Single monitor
- Multiple monitors
- Mixed display scaling
- Display resolution changes
- Standard and high-DPI displays
- Paths containing spaces
- Unicode filenames
- Missing output folders
- Restricted file access
- Low disk space

## Release Tests

- Lint
- TypeScript validation
- Automated tests
- Production frontend build
- Native desktop build
- Installer creation
- Clean installation
- Application launch after installation
- Uninstallation
- No missing runtime dependencies
- No broken tray icon
- No fake or non-functional controls

Do not claim a test passed unless it was actually run.

