- Add proper Quit behaviour.
- Implement global shortcuts.
- Add native window management.

## Phase 4 — Core Capture

- Full-screen capture
- Region capture
- Active-window capture
- Delay
- Multi-monitor support
- Output management

## Phase 5 — Editor and Pinning

