## Phase 6 — Recording

- Screen recording
- Audio input
- Recording controls
- Output verification
- Optional video trimming and audio extraction

## Phase 7 — OCR and Utilities

- OCR
- Image conversion
- PDF export
- Capture history
- Batch utilities

## Phase 8 — Optimization

- Dependency cleanup
- Lazy loading
- Memory improvements
- Installer optimization
- Performance measurements

## Phase 9 — Final QA

